# Supabase Edge Functions Environment Variables
# Copy this file to supabase/.env and fill in your actual values
# This file is for edge function secrets only (not used by the main app)

# Example: API keys for external services used in edge functions
# EXTERNAL_API_KEY=your_external_api_key_here

# Example: Database connection strings (if needed in functions)
# DATABASE_URL=your_database_url_here

# Example: Custom secrets for your edge functions
# CUSTOM_SECRET=your_custom_secret_here

# Note: These secrets are loaded by edge functions at runtime
# They are separate from your main .env.local file
# Never commit supabase/.env with real values
